# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API for the latest version of Qiskit Fermions"
msgstr "Instalace Python API pro nejnovější verzi Qiskit Fermions"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API"
msgstr "Instalace Python API"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API {#install-the-python-api}"
msgstr "Instalace Python API {#install-the-python-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Předpoklady {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Nejprve vytvoř minimální prostředí, ve kterém je nainstalovaný pouze Python. Použij [virtuální prostředí Pythonu](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktivuj své nové prostředí.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Tento balíček lze nainstalovat dvěma hlavními způsoby: z PyPI nebo ze zdrojového kódu. Preferovaná metoda je instalace z PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instalace z PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalace ze zdrojového kódu {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Pokud plánuješ vyvíjet v repozitáři, měl bys instalovat ze zdrojového kódu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-fermions` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Nejprve musí být Qiskit nainstalován ve stejném Python prostředí, do kterého instaluješ `qiskit-fermions`. Nejjednodušší je instalace z PyPI, ale Qiskit můžeš nainstalovat i ze zdrojového kódu, pokud chceš.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-fermions` repository.\n"
msgstr "Dále naklonuj repozitář `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Nyní nainstaluj toolchain Rustu, aktualizuj pip a přejdi do repozitáře. Pokyny k instalaci toolchainu najdeš v [dokumentaci Rustu](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Nainstaluj zbývající závislosti `build`. Pokud plánuješ vyvíjet v repozitáři, nainstaluj také závislosti `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-fermions` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Dalším krokem je instalace `qiskit-fermions` do virtuálního prostředí.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Tip\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Můžeš také provést editovatelnou instalaci a přitom kompilovat podkladový Rust crate v režimu `release`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Některé funkce závisí na volitelných závislostech. Pro instalaci všech z nich použij extra `all`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  V sekci `[project.optional-dependencies]` souboru [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) zjistíš, které skupiny závislostí jsou k dispozici.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-fermions` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Volitelně můžeš ověřit, že instalace proběhla úspěšně. Nejjednodušším testem je zkusit importovat jednu z tříd poskytovaných balíčkem `qiskit-fermions`, jako v následujícím příkladu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Pokud se to dokončí bez chyby, instalace funguje.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Můžeš také spustit celou sadu Python testů:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Pro spuštění testů, které navíc využívají volitelné závislosti, nainstaluj extra balíčky a použij cíl `testoptional`:\n"
